menu "Product Applications"

config OPENEMBER_APP_SMART_DEVICE_DEMO
    bool "Build product app: smart_device_demo"
    default y
    depends on OPENEMBER_ENABLE_LINK
    depends on OPENEMBER_ENABLE_MSGS
    help
      Build a small product-application entry point that initializes OpenEmber
      Link, creates a product node, and publishes openember-msgs NodeHeartbeat
      messages. Use it as a starting point for project-specific apps under
      apps/.

config OPENEMBER_APP_TURTLE_DEMO
    bool "Build product app: turtle_demo (host sim + teleop)"
    default y
    depends on OPENEMBER_ENABLE_LINK
    depends on OPENEMBER_ENABLE_MSGS
    help
      Build a turtlesim-style host demo: openember_turtle_sim integrates
      Twist2D commands into Pose2D and opens an SDL2 window on Linux
      (install libsdl2-dev; use --no-gui for headless). teleop publishes
      keyboard or --demo motion. See configs/turtle.launch.yaml.

config OPENEMBER_APP_ROVER_DEMO
    bool "Build product app: rover_demo (diff-drive host sim)"
    default y
    depends on OPENEMBER_ENABLE_LINK
    depends on OPENEMBER_ENABLE_MSGS
    help
      Build openember_rover_sim / openember_rover_teleop: differential-drive
      kinematics with cmd timeout and /rover/estop safety. See
      configs/rover.launch.yaml and docs/design/rover-demo.md.

config OPENEMBER_APP_AGRI_STATION_DEMO
    bool "Build product app: agri_station_demo (smart agri mock)"
    default y
    depends on OPENEMBER_ENABLE_LINK
    depends on OPENEMBER_ENABLE_MSGS
    help
      Build openember_agri_mock_sensors / openember_agri_station_app: mock
      climate and soil publishers plus a product app with thresholds and
      degrade. See configs/agri_station.launch.yaml and
      docs/design/agri-station-demo.md.

config OPENEMBER_AGRI_STATION_GUI
    bool "Agri station app: Qt field console UI"
    default y
    depends on OPENEMBER_APP_AGRI_STATION_DEMO
    help
      Link agri_station_app against system Qt6/Qt5 Widgets+Charts for an
      on-device field console with nav bar and chart cards (not web). Install
      qt6-base-dev and qt6-charts-dev (or Qt5 equivalents). Use --no-gui /
      --headless when no display is available. Qt is NOT fetched into
      third_party/.

endmenu
